60169f7dc9ddd90061b37fd0,고른햇살,"햇살이 좋은 날 방문했던 고른햇살,,
주말 점심시간에 방문했더니 웨이팅을 했던 분식집. 고대맛집으로 소문날만하다 생각합니다.
저렴한 가격과 그에맞지않은 맛까지,,
리뷰쓰는데 또 먹고싶은건 함정.
라볶이는 김밥천국이 생각나는 맛이였고, 라면은 언제나 정답입니다.
그리고 유명하다고 소문한 고른햇살의 뚱뚱김밥. 속이 꽈악-차서 라볶이에 찍어먹어도 그냥먹어도 라면에 담궈먹어도 그냥 존맛입니다.",5.0,,21.1.31.일,1,19886403,꿀윰이,1,https://pup-review-phinf.pstatic.net/MjAyMzEwMjZfMjM1/MDAxNjk4Mjg1NTQyNDIw.Bsq5Cm1mbUvr734AUgmTkL6_63conhSZxAB6jMiBrWcg.dlqctxZoXTtB5evquH-6MJ44tuDI1rVFkdRMinD9x7Yg.JPEG/upload_798c72ed4a6ec613e56768dc7547181b.jpeg | https://pup-review-phinf.pstatic.net/MjAyMzEwMjZfMTYg/MDAxNjk4Mjg1NTQyNzkw.uwUd7ZcWfHtSVe-K4yhaOViguehWkEnTERdbHrt_ooUg.6TO4SUVYMyuI1MOIMlI7YAaWaJmlvXFfeeUIfLPnhzgg.JPEG/upload_6be1eee3402939774d424533f9eadb78.jpeg?type=w1500_60_sharpen | https://pup-review-phinf.pstatic.net/MjAyMzEwMjZfNTUg/MDAxNjk4Mjg1NTQyNTU2.4wWnkQUsCL5-_DcBhUiEmUxJqBnvjRmJ3qQECuSayLsg.JqDXqk8lFM4Yo2Er_nYe8AVPQOKULlry5HhSktHq3Bcg.JPEG/upload_7ab4a86ebd85efd56003e4ad9dd6dac9.jpeg?type=w1500_60_sharpen | https://pup-review-phinf.pstatic.net/MjAyMzEwMjZfMjg5/MDAxNjk4Mjg1NTQyNDU1.BkBEhnV_VXtNlH-aOGnUy0WAU5xLHH8AAkjzSQ63rSsg.DgDjmLRLAEalHu0io2ZlV5qautEy1rnECKWc5JFMEmog.JPEG/upload_97d28530afc380a0faf5373c69821757.jpeg?type=w1500_60_sharpen,https://pup-review-phinf.pstatic.net/MjAyMzEwMjZfMjM1/MDAxNjk4Mjg1NTQyNDIw.Bsq5Cm1mbUvr734AUgmTkL6_63conhSZxAB6jMiBrWcg.dlqctxZoXTtB5evquH-6MJ44tuDI1rVFkdRMinD9x7Yg.JPEG/upload_798c72ed4a6ec613e56768dc7547181b.jpeg | https://pup-review-phinf.pstatic.net/MjAyMzEwMjZfMTYg/MDAxNjk4Mjg1NTQyNzkw.uwUd7ZcWfHtSVe-K4yhaOViguehWkEnTERdbHrt_ooUg.6TO4SUVYMyuI1MOIMlI7YAaWaJmlvXFfeeUIfLPnhzgg.JPEG/upload_6be1eee3402939774d424533f9eadb78.jpeg?type=w1500_60_sharpen | https://pup-review-phinf.pstatic.net/MjAyMzEwMjZfNTUg/MDAxNjk4Mjg1NTQyNTU2.4wWnkQUsCL5-_DcBhUiEmUxJqBnvjRmJ3qQECuSayLsg.JqDXqk8lFM4Yo2Er_nYe8AVPQOKULlry5HhSktHq3Bcg.JPEG/upload_7ab4a86ebd85efd56003e4ad9dd6dac9.jpeg?type=w1500_60_sharpen | https://pup-review-phinf.pstatic.net/MjAyMzEwMjZfMjg5/MDAxNjk4Mjg1NTQyNDU1.BkBEhnV_VXtNlH-aOGnUy0WAU5xLHH8AAkjzSQ63rSsg.DgDjmLRLAEalHu0io2ZlV5qautEy1rnECKWc5JFMEmog.JPEG/upload_97d28530afc380a0faf5373c69821757.jpeg?type=w1500_60_sharpen,,,4,,,,,김밥,2026-05-27T08:33:25.